  "description": "👑 🔥 ROYALTY 🔥👑 \n\nThe King is here, let thy people know.\n\n\n⚠️ Due to being a NEW guild we will remove lower inactive levels for open applications routinely. Level up quickly to avoid.⚠️ \n\n\n\n🎉 Since December 2024 🎉\n\nA guild for experienced and high-level players.\n\n\n\n\n✅ Join Requirement ✅ \n\nActivity . Maturity . Level 250+\n\nTrainees lvl 150 in 48 hours.\n\n\n\n\n⌚Daily Raid Schedules ⌚\n\nTo be determined \n\n\n🎁🎁🎁 Guild Benefits 🎁🎁🎁\n\nAll members gain experience, tips and recommendations by other players.\n\n\n💫💫💫 Looking for a respectable Guild for Ladies &amp; Gentlemen a like, Join today!\n\n\n✨✨✨ Applications ✨✨✨\n\nOPEN ✅\n\n\n🚫❌ Guild Removal  ❌🚫\n\nMaturity is fundamental for any interactions both private and public. Automatic Ban for any disrespect.\n\nActivity is required but raids are not mandatory at this time. Please make your best effort to participate. \n\nInactivity for several days may be cause for removal.\n\n\nAll active &amp; well mannered players welcomed. Leaders will review applications &amp; monitor all members.\n\n10k 4k TDC RQ G\n5k eil CH.\n10k Drd.",
